      <activity id="ea69b4c1-b3fb-58c9-89e9-f067dfc49cfc" activityNameId="34e6cd9c-8778-530d-93d2-86fdcd857b73" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solder, paste, Sn95.5Ag3.9Cu0.6, for electronics industry, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solder, paste, Sn95.5Ag3.9Cu0.6, for electronics industry, at plant
Data are based on literature (report from a European research project in the field of lead-free soldering). Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions.;
UUID: 4b407104-c117-3fa3-a534-4ab77f39d50a
This dataset includes raw material input, auxillaries input, energy consumption and emissions (air), as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of solder paste.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical solder material for the electronics industry. Production by melting (of solder bar), atomizing &amp; sieving, followed by mixing with the respective flux. Data based on literature.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: own estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4b407104-c117-3fa3-a534-4ab77f39d50a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
